                        <div class="faq-expanded__a"><p>Identify qualified ICAI-registered CA. Obtain consent and eligibility certificate. Pass Board Resolution (first) or Ordinary Resolution at AGM (subsequent). File ADT-1 with ROC Haryana within 15 days. Mandatory for first auditor from July 2025.</p></div>
