                        <h3 class="faq-expanded__q">What is Form ADT-1?</h3>
                        <div class="faq-expanded__a"><p>Statutory notice filed with ROC to intimate auditor appointment. Contains CIN, auditor details, date, term, fees. Due within 15 days on MCA V3. From July 2025, mandatory even for first auditor. Late filing attracts escalating fees.</p></div>
